<title>USA: NYC $626 mln GO bond issue restructured - Lehman.</title>
<headline>NYC $626 mln GO bond issue restructured - Lehman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it restructured a $626 million New York City general obligation bond issue, leaving the top yield in 2026 at 6.32 percent.</p>
</text>
